## The 5 Tools
1. `query_assets` - Filter assets by type, location, health status
2. `analyze_asset_health` - Health trends and risk analysis
3. `predict_failures` - Predictive maintenance (60-90 day forecast)
4. `calculate_tco` - Total Cost of Ownership financial analysis
5. `track_compliance` - Regulatory inspection tracking

